TEXT 48 -272 Left 3 ;#190 2N2222 emitter-resistor current sink
TEXT 48 -208 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xR0RfmmRhDw
TEXT 48 -160 Left 2 ;VSENSE represents Alan's ammeter. RVOM represents his 200k voltmeter on the 10V range.
TEXT 72 496 Left 2 !.dc VFLOAT 0 8 0.05
TEXT 72 528 Left 2 !.meas dc I_AT_10V FIND I(VSENSE) AT=0
TEXT 72 560 Left 2 !.meas dc I_AT_2V FIND I(VSENSE) AT=8
TEXT 72 592 Left 2 !.meas dc VCOL_AT_10V FIND V(COLLECTOR) AT=0
TEXT 72 624 Left 2 !.meas dc VCOL_AT_2V FIND V(COLLECTOR) AT=8
TEXT 72 656 Left 2 !.meas dc ROUT_OHMS PARAM (VCOL_AT_10V-VCOL_AT_2V)/(I_AT_10V-I_AT_2V)
TEXT 72 704 Left 1 ;ROUT_OHMS uses Alan's ammeter reading with his 200k voltmeter connected.
TEXT 72 736 Left 1 ;The common top node is +10 V. Sweeping VFLOAT 0-8 V moves COLLECTOR from 10 V to 2 V.
